giscus-light.css and giscus-dark.css are based on giscus's themes (styles/themes/light.css and dark.css of
https://github.com/giscus/giscus), whose colour variables come from GitHub Primer (https://github.com/primer/primitives).
OpenInfinity changed them to match the blog's palette. Both projects are under the MIT License:

